!!! Inline assembly, REACHED. Sample 13 declares assembly but never calls it,
!!! so it cannot prove the rejection story. This page calls the assembly
!!! paragraph, which makes the route split observable:
!!!
!!!   - the four interpreted routes refuse to run it, with a diagnostic that
!!!     names the route, because erasing or emulating machine assembly in an
!!!     interpreter would make one program mean two different things;
!!!   - the LLVM routes execute the same NIL and print bswapq(1).
book tour.asm-called

swap-bytes receives word as number returns number begin paragraph
    variable result as number is 0
    assembly for x86_64 is "movq $1, $0; bswapq $0" using word giving result
    give result
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph
    say swap-bytes with word being 1
    give 0
end paragraph
